  "identity": "Eight-note C-major call and answer in syncopated 6/8. The lead uses clipped attacks and fast releases: three quick notes, a punctuating F, a real breath filled only by the mark-lock cue, then a rising four-note answer that resolves before the sweep. Bass and chord tones are short synchronized hits, never a bed. Three high additive FM chimes add E6/G6/C7 sparkle; music stays clear of the sweep and tail cues.",
